{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"English Literature - Daily Quiz": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) ‘The Rape of the Lock’ was written by -", "option1": "ক) Jonathan Swift", "option2": "খ) Daniel Defoe", "option3": "গ) Henry Fielding", "option4": "ঘ) Alexander Pope", "answer": "4", "exp": ""}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) Who wrote ‘A Tale of Tub’ and ‘Gulliver’s Travels’?", "option1": "ক) Jonathan Swift", "option2": "খ) John Dryden", "option3": "গ) Samuel Butler", "option4": "ঘ) Alexander Pope", "answer": "1", "exp": ""}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) The Augustan Age is also called the -", "option1": "ক) Age of Pope", "option2": "খ) Age of Fielding", "option3": "গ) Age of Johnson", "option4": "ঘ) Age of Milton", "answer": "1", "exp": ""}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) Robinson Crusoe was written by -", "option1": "ক) Jonathan Swift", "option2": "খ) Daniel Defoe", "option3": "গ) Samuel Richardson", "option4": "ঘ) Alexander Pope", "answer": "2", "exp": ""}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) Age of Johnson is named after -", "option1": "ক) Ben Johnson", "option2": "খ) Samuel Johnson", "option3": "গ) John Dryden", "option4": "ঘ) King Johnson", "answer": "2", "exp": ""}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) ‘Elegy written in the country churchyard’ was written by -", "option1": "ক) Thomas Gray", "option2": "খ) Edmund Burke", "option3": "গ) Henry Fielding", "option4": "ঘ) Edward Gibbon", "answer": "1", "exp": ""}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) Who wrote ‘Pride and Prejudice’?", "option1": "ক) Lord Byron", "option2": "খ) Jane Austen", "option3": "গ) John Keats", "option4": "ঘ) Charles Lamb", "answer": "2", "exp": ""}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) Which one is by Keats, not Shelley?", "option1": "ক) Endymion", "option2": "খ) Prometheus Unbound", "option3": "গ) Adonais", "option4": "ঘ) Ozymandias", "answer": "1", "exp": ""}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) ‘Songs of Innocence’ is by -", "option1": "ক) William Blake", "option2": "খ) Edmund Burke", "option3": "গ) Oliver Goldsmith", "option4": "ঘ) S